    {
      "id": "r_phone_use",
      "kind": "routine",
      "description": "Ordinary phone use while awake. About 39 uses a day from this rule (Winbush et al. 2025, 10,099 US adults: median 1.71 unlocks per hour, 41 a day) and about 5 hours of app time a day (data.ai Korea Q1 2022: 5.2 h). A university student: more video and social media than the Korean all-age per-app averages (WiseApp 2025).",
